WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Farmers Market Ribbon Cutting. Silent clip.]

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Gus is handed oversized scissors for the ribbon cutting.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.600
Gus flaps, honks, and eats the ribbon.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600
Shoppers abandon their tomatoes and flee. The scissors are fine.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.000
Gus has been asked to stay in the parking lot next time.
